{"abstract":"I dette interview diskuterer tre samfundsvidenskabeligere forskere fra CSS – lektor i sociologi Anders Blok, professor i statskundskab Rebecca Adler-Nissen og professor i antropologi Morten Axel Pedersen – deres erfaringer med og tanker om det at arbejde med Big Data, „computational social science“, heterogene datatyper og tværfagligt samarbejde i forbindelse med projekter på Copenhagen Center for Social Data Science, SODAS","author_count":2,"contributors":["Madsen, Mette My","Schyberg, Katinka Amalie"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-829213"],"filters":{"added":"2025-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"samfundsvidenskaberne og de store data interview med anders blok rebecca adler nissen og morten axel pedersen","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.7146/ta.v0i79.122274","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-829213","identifier":[{"id":"85137576396","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-7af91ef5-008b-4ef8-ab01-9ce807280bbe"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-B279A555D0A29168486F8D8656CAC045"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.7146/ta.v0i79.122274","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Social Sciences, Department of Anthropology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"My","key":"madsenpau","last":"Madsen","lo